@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

c:graph-algorithm v:uses c:graph-graph-theory .
c:shortest-path-problem skos:related c:path-graph-theory .
c:bayesian-network v:uses c:directed-acyclic-graph .
c:bayesian-network skos:related c:knowledge-representation .
